        STATUS(InternalError, \"Failed to get db oid\"));\r\n        }\r\n```\r\n\r\nThere should be a return after context.RespondRpcFailure.\n\n### Issue Type\n\nkind/bug\n\n### Warning: Please confirm that this issue does not contain any sensitive information\n\n- [X] I confirm this issue does not contain any sensitive information.\n\n[DB-14441]: https://yugabyte.atlassian.net/browse/DB-14441?atlOrigin=eyJpIjoiNWRkNTljNzYxNjVmNDY3MDlhMDU5Y2ZhYzA5YTRkZjUiLCJwIjoiZ2l0aHViLWNvbS1KU1cifQ","closed_by":{"login":"myang2021","id":79478033,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc5NDc4MDMz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/79478033?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/myang2021","html_url":"https://github.com/myang2021","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myang2021/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myang2021/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myang2021/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myang2021/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myang2021/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myang2021/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myang2021/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myang2021/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myang2021/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/25249/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/25249/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}